{ This is my first game against a Super GM: Vidit Gujrathi. This was part of an online simul against him while he had clocks running, incredible work by him. I put some pressure on him in the middlegame (his words not mine) but later blundered an exchange. Later on, I even had some chances to equalize. It was nice to see how even Super GMs can mess up and not play perfect chess. }
